<title>Israel and Hezbollah: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/lebanon/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-lebanon-2026-11-24T23:34:15.903Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:34:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli artillery and airstrikes continue targeting southern Lebanese towns such as Wadi Zibqin and other border communities, while Hezbollah maintains its fire and expands its arsenal, including reported shipments and activity in Yemen. The Israeli government has redirected $90 million from border community recovery budgets to defense and is delaying completion of the Lebanon border wall, while US sanctions on Hezbollah affiliates are seen as having limited impact. Iranian forces are reported to be developing chemical weapons, and Iran’s Revolutionary Guards have been ordered to leave Beirut strongholds, indicating a shift in regional involvement. Civilian areas and health facilities in Lebanon remain under attack, and UN peacekeepers are surrounded by devastation. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/24/us-sanctions-on-lebanons-hezbollah-affiliates-may-have-limited-impact?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANI News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQZEpNUTFySEFLUFFrSkJDWUJDdWc5LWU5ams2U3FJN3hXOHRneTVvblg0VzNjUWdjU0tFSFRBTWVrYlRHblNaX1NmTDJEWXJDeHNBWHJwNjM5cVR2RzZnUk5kVUlZSjVUWGJoZXJVLThGRnVERnRzNEpqOWFNTzBHM1o1ZUMxUzlkWlUzU2c4M3pTOHVMczFZZTEzQW1Lenc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Doctors Without Borders&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQWm5HcTQ4LU9ZUHhua2d6dVczVTJO